<!-- ============================================================
     FAQ SECTION
============================================================ -->
<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="faq-layout">
            <div class="faq-left">
                <span class="section-badge">Got Questions?</span>
                <h2 class="section-title left">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle left">
                    Everything you need to know about SmartFarm platform before
                    getting started.
                </p>
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497440001374-f26997328c1b?w=450&q=80"
                     alt="Farmer in wheat field"
                     class="faq-image" />
            </div>
            <div class="faq-right">

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-1">
                        <span>Who can use the SmartFarm platform?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-1">
                        <p>SmartFarm is designed for Farmers, Agronomists, Field Officers, Cooperative Managers, Buyers, and Administrators. Each role gets a dedicated dashboard with relevant tools and access permissions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-2">
                        <span>Is this platform available on mobile devices?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-2">
                        <p>Yes, SmartFarm is fully responsive and works on all devices including smartphones, tablets, and desktops.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-3">
                        <span>How does soil and weather monitoring work?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-3">
                        <p>IoT soil sensors installed in your fields continuously send readings to our platform. You can view moisture, temperature, pH, and rainfall data in real-time. Automated alerts notify you when values go outside optimal thresholds.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-4">
                        <span>Can I sell my produce directly through this platform?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-4">
                        <p>Yes! After logging your harvest, you can list your produce in the integrated marketplace. Verified buyers on the platform can browse listings, negotiate, and initiate purchase transactions directly.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-5">
                        <span>Is my farm data secure and private?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-5">
                        <p>Absolutely. All data is stored on secured SQL Server databases with role-based access control. Only you and authorized users in your cooperative or organization can view your farm information.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" id="faq-btn-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-6">
                        <span>How do I get started?</span>
                        <span class="material-icons faq-arrow">expand_more</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-ans-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-6">
                        <p>Click the Register button, fill in your details and select your role. Once registered, your account is verified and you can start adding farm information, planning crops, and using all platform features immediately.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

